  "description": "Product Description\nAdd a touch of timeless elegance to your special day with this beautiful bundle of hand-drawn vintage wedding and romance clipart. Featuring an intricate collection of bridal elements including a kissing bride and groom, cupid, wedding rings, a tiered cake, vintage getaway car, floral wreaths and arches, a camera, bridal veil, wedding bells, and floral bouquets, this set is perfect for designing elegant wedding invitations, “save the date” cards, bridal shower menus, scrapbooking, and romantic stickers.\nWhat’s Included in This Download:\nPNG Files: High-resolution transparent PNG files (4500 x 5400 px, 300 DPI)\nEPS Files: Fully scalable and editable vector files (compatible with Adobe Illustrator and other vector software)\nFeatures:\nAuthentic hand-drawn engraved sketch style line art\nCrisp, scalable vector paths for infinite resizing without quality loss\nTransparent background files ready for high-resolution printing and digital crafts",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Product Description</p>\n<p>Add a touch of timeless elegance to your special day with this beautiful bundle of hand-drawn vintage wedding and romance clipart. Featuring an intricate collection of bridal elements including a kissing bride and groom, cupid, wedding rings, a tiered cake, vintage getaway car, floral wreaths and arches, a camera, bridal veil, wedding bells, and floral bouquets, this set is perfect for designing elegant wedding invitations, “save the date” cards, bridal shower menus, scrapbooking, and romantic stickers.</p>\n<p>What’s Included in This Download:</p>\n<p>PNG Files: High-resolution transparent PNG files (4500 x 5400 px, 300 DPI)</p>\n<p>EPS Files: Fully scalable and editable vector files (compatible with Adobe Illustrator and other vector software)</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<p>Authentic hand-drawn engraved sketch style line art</p>\n<p>Crisp, scalable vector paths for infinite resizing without quality loss</p>\n<p>Transparent background files ready for high-resolution printing and digital crafts</p>",
